#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/simulating-ORegan-2022-parameter-set.ipynb:9
msgid "Run simulations with O'Regan 2022 parameter set (LG M50)"
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/simulating-ORegan-2022-parameter-set.ipynb:11
msgid ""
"In this notebook we show an example on how to run the DFN model with the "
"O'Regan 2022 parameter set for the LG M50 cell. Because of the concentration "
"dependent diffusion coefficient, we need to customise the mesh so the "
"simulations converge."
msgstr ""

#: ../../../source/examples/notebooks/models/simulating-ORegan-2022-parameter-set.ipynb:-1
msgid "[1]:"
msgstr ""

